  "description": "Activates Plgic.Dicom licenses on the machine that runs your application: shows the machine id, exchanges a license key (free Developer key or paid key) for a signed, machine-bound license, saves it where your application can load it, creates offline activation requests for air-gapped machines and imports the license file the portal returns. Command: plgic-activate.",
